A path difference of n lambda gives a bright point, an odd number of half wavelengths a dark one.

4
00:00:13,802 --> 00:00:21,419
Only coherent sources, with a constant phase difference, give steady fringes, so we make them from one source.

5
00:00:21,419 --> 00:00:28,489
